+/*
+ * CONTIG HINT SUPPORT TABLE
+ *
+ *---------------------------------------------------
+ *| Page Size | CONT PTE |  PMD  | CONT PMD |  PUD  |
+ *---------------------------------------------------
+ *|     4K    |   64K    |   2M  |    32M   |   1G  |
+ *|    16K    |    2M    |  32M  |     1G   |       |
+ *|    64K    |    2M    | 512M  |    16G   |       |
